msgid "Reference"
msgstr "参考"

#: ../../en/reference/data-contracts.md:10
msgid "Data contracts"
msgstr "数据契约"

#: ../../en/reference/data-contracts.md:12
msgid "Graph document"
msgstr "图文档"

#: ../../en/reference/data-contracts.md:14
msgid "Graph document version: `1`."
msgstr "图文档版本：`1`。"

#: ../../en/reference/data-contracts.md:25
msgid ""
"A node requires `id` and a generated `type`; it also carries `position`, "
"validated `data`, and optional parent-layout fields. An edge requires "
"`id`, `source`, and `target`, with nullable `sourceHandle` and "
"`targetHandle`."
msgstr ""
"节点需要 `id` 和生成的 `type`；它还包含 `position`、经过验证的 `data` 以及可选的父级布局字段。边需要 "
"`id`、`source` 和 `target`，其中 `sourceHandle` 与 `targetHandle` 可以为 null。"

#: ../../en/reference/data-contracts.md:29
msgid ""
"Only serialized edges determine dependencies. Position and viewport are "
"editor state and do not connect nodes."
msgstr "只有序列化的边决定依赖关系。位置和视口属于编辑器状态，不会连接节点。"

#: ../../en/reference/data-contracts.md:32
msgid "Source: `comfy_research/schemas/graph.py`."
msgstr "来源：`comfy_research/schemas/graph.py`。"

#: ../../en/reference/data-contracts.md:34
msgid "Workspace snapshot"
msgstr "工作区快照"

#: ../../en/reference/data-contracts.md:36
msgid "Workspace snapshot version: `3`."
msgstr "工作区快照版本：`3`。"

#: ../../en/reference/data-contracts.md:38
msgid ""
"The root contains `active_project_id` and one or more projects. Each "
"project owns exactly one canvas. `active_project_id` is validated against"
" the project collection. To compare variants, use one project per "
"variant."
msgstr ""
"根对象包含 `active_project_id` 和一个或多个项目。每个项目恰好拥有一张画布。`active_project_id` "
"会针对项目集合进行验证。若要比较不同变体，请为每个变体使用一个项目。"

#: ../../en/reference/data-contracts.md:42
msgid ""
"`GET /api/workspace` loads `data/workspace.json` when it exists. If it is"
" absent, the backend creates and persists a fresh version-3 workspace "
"with one project and one canvas. An invalid existing workspace is an "
"error rather than an instruction to silently discard state."
msgstr ""
"`GET /api/workspace` 会在 `data/workspace.json` "
"存在时加载它。若该文件不存在，后端会创建并持久化一个全新的版本 3 工作区，其中包含一个项目和一张画布。现有工作区无效会报错，而不会静默丢弃状态。"

#: ../../en/reference/data-contracts.md:47
msgid ""
"Source: `comfy_research/schemas/workspace.py` and "
"`comfy_research/api/workspace.py`."
msgstr ""
"来源：`comfy_research/schemas/workspace.py` 和 "
"`comfy_research/api/workspace.py`。"

