msgstr "过滤契约"

#: ../../en/reference/data-contracts.md:6
msgid "Small"
msgstr "小"

#: ../../en/reference/data-contracts.md:6
msgid ""
"Remove checkpoint bytes and known plot, visualization, and runtime "
"histories"
msgstr "移除检查点字节以及已知的绘图、可视化和运行时历史"

#: ../../en/reference/data-contracts.md:6
