msgstr "中"

#: ../../en/reference/data-contracts.md:6
msgid "Remove checkpoint bytes but retain plot and visualization data"
msgstr "移除检查点字节，但保留绘图和可视化数据"

#: ../../en/reference/data-contracts.md:6
