msgstr "大"

#: ../../en/reference/data-contracts.md:6
msgid "Return the full graph document unchanged"
msgstr "原样返回完整图文档"

#: ../../en/reference/data-contracts.md:77
msgid ""
"The tier describes filtering, not confidentiality. Inspect all documents "
"before publishing them."
msgstr "层级描述的是过滤，而非保密性。发布前请检查所有文档。"
